{
  "10301": {
    "Id": 10301,
    "Character": 103,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_103_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "我，琥珀。\n……鸢尾替我写了一份自我介绍，我稍后发邮件给你。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "10302": {
    "Id": 10302,
    "Character": 103,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_103_ui_gacha_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "我们已经这么熟了，所以……不用再自我介绍了吧？",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "10303": {
    "Id": 10303,
    "Character": 103,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_103_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "魔王，我有成长吗？",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "10304": {
    "Id": 10304,
    "Character": 103,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_103_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "来抱抱……啊，我说的是这只猫。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "10305": {
    "Id": 10305,
    "Character": 103,
    "Type": 5,
    "SkinId": 10303,
    "VoResource": "",
    "HasVoResource": false,
    "Lines": "锦绣织就流火，金饰点缀祥云。不怒自威、顾盼神飞。\n嘎呜——",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "10701": {
    "Id": 10701,
    "Character": 107,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_107_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "报告！我是代表正义的骑士侍从缇莉娅。来成为我的伙伴一起伸张正义吧！",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "10702": {
    "Id": 10702,
    "Character": 107,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_107_ui_gacha_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "又见面啦，正义的伙伴！",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "10703": {
    "Id": 10703,
    "Character": 107,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_107_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "咦……骏鹰号的声音怎么有点不对劲……哇哇哇——！",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "10704": {
    "Id": 10704,
    "Character": 107,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_107_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "谢谢你，来见证我踏上英雄之路。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "10705": {
    "Id": 10705,
    "Character": 107,
    "Type": 5,
    "SkinId": 10703,
    "VoResource": "",
    "HasVoResource": false,
    "Lines": "系紧腰带，利落变身，斗志如烈阳般炽热！\u000b披上正义的战衣，以骑士之姿守护每一条街道——\u000b此即吾之正义！",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "10801": {
    "Id": 10801,
    "Character": 108,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_108_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "白猫剧团第三小队队长，卡西米拉。这是我们的合作协议，请在上面签名吧。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "10802": {
    "Id": 10802,
    "Character": 108,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_108_ui_gacha_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "你是个不错的雇主。能继续与你合作……我很高兴。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "10803": {
    "Id": 10803,
    "Character": 108,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_108_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "这是补充协议，请。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "10804": {
    "Id": 10804,
    "Character": 108,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_108_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "我终于意识到，原来你才是我最灵验的幸运护符。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11001": {
    "Id": 11001,
    "Character": 110,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_110_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "翡冷翠，你的盟友。我会向你展现我的价值，也请你不要令我失望。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11002": {
    "Id": 11002,
    "Character": 110,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_110_ui_gacha_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "聪明人之间，就不必重复客套话了——说出你特地找我的理由吧，我都会奉陪。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11003": {
    "Id": 11003,
    "Character": 110,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_110_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "……是时候签个新契约了，让我们的合作……更进一步吧……！",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11004": {
    "Id": 11004,
    "Character": 110,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_110_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "既然选择了与我一起……就意味着，你已经逃不出我的掌心了喔……",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11101": {
    "Id": 11101,
    "Character": 111,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_111_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "我叫鸢尾，那个……有什么做的不好的地方，请多多指教。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11102": {
    "Id": 11102,
    "Character": 111,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_111_ui_gacha_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "我回来了，==PLAYER_NAME==。这是打工的收入，请帮我存起来，作为旅团的风险准备金吧。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11103": {
    "Id": 11103,
    "Character": 111,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_111_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "我的手提包可是很沉的，别小看知识的重量！",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11104": {
    "Id": 11104,
    "Character": 111,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_111_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "谢谢你给我买的曲奇，很好吃……真是的，要是之后再也吃不到这么好吃的曲奇，我一定会难过的。你要负起责任来啊，约好了。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11105": {
    "Id": 11105,
    "Character": 111,
    "Type": 5,
    "SkinId": 11103,
    "VoResource": "",
    "HasVoResource": false,
    "Lines": "冬日清冷阳光下的你，捧着热饮呼出白气的你，自诩平凡普通的你，却构成了这个日子全部的意义。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11201": {
    "Id": 11201,
    "Character": 112,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_112_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "我们走吧，魔王大人，有很多很多星塔在等着我们！",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11202": {
    "Id": 11202,
    "Character": 112,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_112_ui_gacha_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "对旅人来说，相逢即是有缘，再遇便是命运……不像我说的话吗？",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11203": {
    "Id": 11203,
    "Character": 112,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_112_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "接下来的旅程，大家还要继续在一起！",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11204": {
    "Id": 11204,
    "Character": 112,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_112_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "等小绿修好之后，我可以带魔王大人去个很适合观赏星塔的地方哦。\n就我们两个人。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11205": {
    "Id": 11205,
    "Character": 112,
    "Type": 5,
    "SkinId": 11203,
    "VoResource": "",
    "HasVoResource": false,
    "Lines": "来到大海，来到沙滩，当然得换上泳衣。\u000b怀抱热情的太阳，享受海浪的轻拍——与夏天的亲密接触，得务必注意防晒！",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11301": {
    "Id": 11301,
    "Character": 113,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_113_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "我是白泽公署的师渺，今后由我来接手与贵旅团的相关合作事宜，还望合作愉快。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11302": {
    "Id": 11302,
    "Character": 113,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_113_ui_gacha_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "又见面了魔王。有个紧急委托需要你的帮助，具体内容我会在路上告知。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11303": {
    "Id": 11303,
    "Character": 113,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_113_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "水，以不变呈万态。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11304": {
    "Id": 11304,
    "Character": 113,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_113_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "又、又是火锅吗？！没有不满，我只是想纠正一下大家对龙裔喜欢吃火锅的刻板印象。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
