  "11601": {
    "Id": 11601,
    "Character": 116,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_116_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "我是联合种业的温室管理员岭川，初次见面，请、请多指教……",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11602": {
    "Id": 11602,
    "Character": 116,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_116_ui_gacha_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "这次……我给你带了一点礼物！是我种的蔬菜，刚从地里摘的，很新鲜很好吃哦。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11603": {
    "Id": 11603,
    "Character": 116,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_116_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "总有一天，我会拥有属于自己的超大田地，想种什么种什么。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11604": {
    "Id": 11604,
    "Character": 116,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_116_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "呜呜……怎么会变成这样……魔王，快帮帮我……我一个人没办法……！",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11701": {
    "Id": 11701,
    "Character": 117,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_117_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "魔王好！我是怀璟食府的璟麟，今后请多多照顾我们家的生意呀！",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11702": {
    "Id": 11702,
    "Character": 117,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_117_ui_gacha_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "我让后厨给魔王开个小灶吧。嘿嘿，不麻烦不麻烦，你可是我们家的熟客呀！",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11703": {
    "Id": 11703,
    "Character": 117,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_117_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "璟麟，威风凛凛！\n——拍好了吗？脚、脚有点酸了……",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11704": {
    "Id": 11704,
    "Character": 117,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_117_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "科学麻雀牌才是唯一出路！魔王，你也认同这一点吧？唔唔，不愧是我的牌搭子！",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11801": {
    "Id": 11801,
    "Character": 118,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_118_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "你就是魔王大人吗？久仰大名，请务必让我替你做个“全身检查”。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11802": {
    "Id": 11802,
    "Character": 118,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_118_ui_gacha_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "看来我们还挺有缘的，要不来我诊所坐坐？",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11803": {
    "Id": 11803,
    "Character": 118,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_118_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "镰刀在低吟，它也很喜欢这份力量。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11804": {
    "Id": 11804,
    "Character": 118,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_118_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "摸一摸它，我烦躁的内心就能平静下来……",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11901": {
    "Id": 11901,
    "Character": 119,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_119_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "谷风家政，满足您日常生活的一切需求。初次见面，我是女仆花原，请多关照。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11902": {
    "Id": 11902,
    "Character": 119,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_119_ui_gacha_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "很高兴又和您见面，这次需要哪些服务？",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11903": {
    "Id": 11903,
    "Character": 119,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_119_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "如真似幻，如影随形。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11904": {
    "Id": 11904,
    "Character": 119,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_119_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "这份特别的礼物……我会好好珍藏。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "11905": {
    "Id": 11905,
    "Character": 119,
    "Type": 5,
    "SkinId": 11903,
    "VoResource": "",
    "HasVoResource": false,
    "Lines": "风摇云影间，曦光舞沙尘。与君共度时，唯有花窥见。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "12001": {
    "Id": 12001,
    "Character": 120,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_120_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "初次见面，我是星辉附属大学的老师，叫我卡娜丝就好，你就是传说中的魔王啊……呵呵，很期待与你接下来的合作。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "12002": {
    "Id": 12002,
    "Character": 120,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_120_ui_gacha_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "又见面了！如何，旅途中有没有新的发现？",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "12003": {
    "Id": 12003,
    "Character": 120,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_120_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "看来我得拿出真正的实力来回应你了。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "12004": {
    "Id": 12004,
    "Character": 120,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_120_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "和你在一起能学到不少东西，当了老师之后，这样的感觉还是头一次。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "12301": {
    "Id": 12301,
    "Character": 123,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_123_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "魔魔王~杏子终于见到你啦，诶嘿，能带杏子一起去冒险吗~",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "12302": {
    "Id": 12302,
    "Character": 123,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_123_ui_gacha_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "哇~魔魔王又找到杏子啦~那下次轮到杏子来找你啦~",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "12303": {
    "Id": 12303,
    "Character": 123,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_123_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "杏子和可可泡泡都变得更厉害啦~魔魔王快跟上，我们要去打坏人啦！",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "12304": {
    "Id": 12304,
    "Character": 123,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_123_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "呼……杏子，要和大家一起，永远都不要分开……",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "12501": {
    "Id": 12501,
    "Character": 125,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_125_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "很荣幸与您同行，请多指教。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "12502": {
    "Id": 12502,
    "Character": 125,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_125_ui_gacha_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "人们都说“重逢令人欣喜”……魔王，您是怎么看的呢？",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "12503": {
    "Id": 12503,
    "Character": 125,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_125_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "我将铲除妨碍您的一切。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "12504": {
    "Id": 12504,
    "Character": 125,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_125_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "我好像……开始喜欢下雨天了。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "12505": {
    "Id": 12505,
    "Character": 125,
    "Type": 5,
    "SkinId": 12503,
    "VoResource": "",
    "HasVoResource": false,
    "Lines": "她所期盼的雪愿节，是一炉温暖的火焰，一杯香甜的果酿，亲密好友的笑语，以及一份来自你的、独一无二的礼物。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "12601": {
    "Id": 12601,
    "Character": 126,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_126_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "初次见面，我是魔术师紫槿，也许你曾听过有关我的各种传闻……呵呵，很在意？但对于魔术来说，是真是假，又有什么关系呢？",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "12602": {
    "Id": 12602,
    "Character": 126,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_126_ui_gacha_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "同样的手法我不会演示两遍，这一次，请仔细看清楚了~",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "12603": {
    "Id": 12603,
    "Character": 126,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_126_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "盛大的演出就要开始了，将这份奇迹牢记于心吧！",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "12604": {
    "Id": 12604,
    "Character": 126,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_126_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "看入迷了？好啦，快点来帮忙吧，演出就要开始了。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "12701": {
    "Id": 12701,
    "Character": 127,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_127_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "喔~又发现一条新航道！\n哼哼~我是万送屋的特丽莎，想寄信时，您和我说一声就行。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "12702": {
    "Id": 12702,
    "Character": 127,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_127_ui_gacha_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "又见面了，魔王，万送屋的服务您还满意吗？",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "12703": {
    "Id": 12703,
    "Character": 127,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_127_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "现在的我，说不定连传说中的龙也能打倒呢！",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "12704": {
    "Id": 12704,
    "Character": 127,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_127_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "真是的……好像什么都瞒不住你呢……",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "13001": {
    "Id": 13001,
    "Character": 130,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_130_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "???",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "13002": {
    "Id": 13002,
    "Character": 130,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_130_ui_gacha_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "???",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "13003": {
    "Id": 13003,
    "Character": 130,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_130_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "???",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "13004": {
    "Id": 13004,
    "Character": 130,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_130_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "???",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "13201": {
    "Id": 13201,
    "Character": 132,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_132_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "魔王，第一次正式合作，灰风不会辜负你的期望。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "13202": {
    "Id": 13202,
    "Character": 132,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_132_ui_gacha_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "魔王，又见面了，我们的默契又多了一些。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "13203": {
    "Id": 13203,
    "Character": 132,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_132_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "只要和伙伴在一起就没什么好怕的。魔王，我们一起前进吧。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "13204": {
    "Id": 13204,
    "Character": 132,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_132_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "别光看我啊……你也坐过来挑本漫画看吧。会很开心的。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "13205": {
    "Id": 13205,
    "Character": 132,
    "Type": 5,
    "SkinId": 13203,
    "VoResource": "",
    "HasVoResource": false,
    "Lines": "手臂传来课桌板的清凉，后背感知洒落阳光的温暖。\u000b书本的芬芳令人陶醉——这是一场微醺的白日梦。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "13301": {
    "Id": 13301,
    "Character": 133,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_133_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "你好，我是夏花。希望我能在未来的旅程中帮上你的忙，也希望你能给予我信赖，以后请多指教。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "13302": {
    "Id": 13302,
    "Character": 133,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_133_ui_gacha_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "又见面了，感觉如何？\n……呵呵，我还挺开心的。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "13303": {
    "Id": 13303,
    "Character": 133,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_133_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "风与我同在。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "13304": {
    "Id": 13304,
    "Character": 133,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_133_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "下次有机会的话，我们再一起去哪里逛逛吧？",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "13401": {
    "Id": 13401,
    "Character": 134,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_134_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "师父您好！我……我我、我是冬香！\n……呜呜，怎么会这样，明明私下里练习了那么久，却还是咬到舌头了……",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "13402": {
    "Id": 13402,
    "Character": 134,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_134_ui_gacha_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "又、又见面了，如果您还需要我和花令旅团的力量，那就太好了……",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "13403": {
    "Id": 13403,
    "Character": 134,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_134_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "为了回报您的信任，我一定会加倍努力！",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "13404": {
    "Id": 13404,
    "Character": 134,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_134_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "呜，请、请不要盯着我看……",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "13405": {
    "Id": 13405,
    "Character": 134,
    "Type": 5,
    "SkinId": 13403,
    "VoResource": "",
    "HasVoResource": false,
    "Lines": "按时打卡不迟到，材料认真准备好。勤勤恳恳，战战兢兢。哎呦喂——扑通，怎么还是搞砸了？",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "13501": {
    "Id": 13501,
    "Character": 135,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_135_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "找到你了！最近很火的那位魔王大人!\n我叫雾语……既是天才的魔女也是敏锐的记者！接受我的采访吧！",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "13502": {
    "Id": 13502,
    "Character": 135,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_135_ui_gacha_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "茄子！我又来拜访了！\n诶~这是啥表情？让我多收集收集！",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "13503": {
    "Id": 13503,
    "Character": 135,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_135_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "和魔女一起，窥探世界的秘密吧！",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "13504": {
    "Id": 13504,
    "Character": 135,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_135_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "我的秘密，你已经尽收眼底了！你的秘密，也快点呈上来吧！",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "13505": {
    "Id": 13505,
    "Character": 135,
    "Type": 5,
    "SkinId": 13503,
    "VoResource": "",
    "HasVoResource": false,
    "Lines": "CharGetLines.13505.1",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "14101": {
    "Id": 14101,
    "Character": 141,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_141_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "我乃赤霞，云笈道场的正统玄师。初来乍到，愿以玄之法理……呃，这开场白好难背。总之，要给你画几张符吗？绝对灵验，不灵包售后。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "14102": {
    "Id": 14102,
    "Character": 141,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_141_ui_gacha_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "又见面啦，看你气色不错，甚好甚好~怎么样，上次给你的符效果不错吧，要回购些不？",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "14103": {
    "Id": 14103,
    "Character": 141,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_141_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "炎符天降，火德显彰。火符闪耀，赤焰昭昭。邪魅消散，万祸不殃。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "14104": {
    "Id": 14104,
    "Character": 141,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_141_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "那、那你现在就发誓，说你哪儿都不去，就呆在我旁边……动一下也不行！",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "14201": {
    "Id": 14201,
    "Character": 142,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_142_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "我是珂赛特，永夜的清道夫。你……欸？魔王？不好，竟然这么轻易就在魔王面前暴露长相了……",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "14202": {
    "Id": 14202,
    "Character": 142,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_142_ui_gacha_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "啊哈哈……又、又见面啦？我明明藏得很好啊……",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "14203": {
    "Id": 14203,
    "Character": 142,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_142_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "再怎么说，我也是永夜的清道夫，可不要小瞧我啊！",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "14204": {
    "Id": 14204,
    "Character": 142,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_142_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "饮料好像卡住了，拿不出来，怎么办？摇一摇有用吗？",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "14401": {
    "Id": 14401,
    "Character": 144,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_144_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "妾身乃风息岛上精心锻造的利刃，名为千都世。为守护主公，妾身必将以至诚之心，竭力侍奉。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "14402": {
    "Id": 14402,
    "Character": 144,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_144_ui_gacha_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "“纵然梦里常幽会，怎比真如见一回。”主公，又见到您真是太好了。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "14403": {
    "Id": 14403,
    "Character": 144,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_144_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "此刃此心，已不再迟疑。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "14404": {
    "Id": 14404,
    "Character": 144,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_144_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "主公，让我一直为您所用，好吗？",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "14701": {
    "Id": 14701,
    "Character": 147,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_147_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "自由贝斯手——焦糖！是名用琴弦连接星塔之音的乐手∼",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "14702": {
    "Id": 14702,
    "Character": 147,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_147_ui_gacha_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "您又来听我演奏啦~难道说……制作人喜欢上我的贝斯了？！这次想听什么曲子呢？",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "14703": {
    "Id": 14703,
    "Character": 147,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_147_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "我，即是那迫近的风暴！",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "14704": {
    "Id": 14704,
    "Character": 147,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_147_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "我的心声，有成功传达给你吗，制作人？",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "14901": {
    "Id": 14901,
    "Character": 149,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_149_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "我是恩赐意志的格芮，只要你能满足我心底的渴望，我就会为你展示更多“特别”的东西……呵呵，请不要让我等得太久哦。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "14902": {
    "Id": 14902,
    "Character": 149,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_149_ui_gacha_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "魔王大人，只有您才能让我感受到满足……请给予我更多吧，我会把渴望与沉沦……全部奉献给您！",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "14903": {
    "Id": 14903,
    "Character": 149,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_149_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "你不打算牵住我的项圈吗？可是……我的灵魂已经忍耐不住震颤了……不要欺负人嘛……",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "14904": {
    "Id": 14904,
    "Character": 149,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_149_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "呵呵~握住别人的灵魂，感觉如何？",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "15001": {
    "Id": 15001,
    "Character": 150,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_150_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "感到荣幸吧！在你面前的可是恩赐意志的精英——菈露大人！等会……我先接个电话。\n啊~老大！您讲，我在听。我……我现在正在出差，是是，那件事今天一定搞定，哪怕熬夜也会搞定。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "15002": {
    "Id": 15002,
    "Character": 150,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_150_ui_gacha_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "哦，又见面了。有什么需求？先说说看吧。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "15003": {
    "Id": 15003,
    "Character": 150,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_150_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "休息得差不多了，下面就让你见识见识我的真本事吧。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "15004": {
    "Id": 15004,
    "Character": 150,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_150_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "对不起嘛~下次绝不会再犯了，我保证~\n——学会了吗？菈露大人的职场求生技。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "15501": {
    "Id": 15501,
    "Character": 155,
    "Type": 1,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_155_ui_gachaNew_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "正式自我介绍一下，我是希娅。你的身上，有着可以信任的气味呢。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "15502": {
    "Id": 15502,
    "Character": 155,
    "Type": 2,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_155_ui_gacha_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "又见面了~看来我们之间的缘分，比帆船的缆绳还要坚固呢。",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "15503": {
    "Id": 15503,
    "Character": 155,
    "Type": 3,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_155_ui_unlockLook_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "一起来感受冲浪的魅力吧！",
    "HasLines": true
  },
  "15504": {
    "Id": 15504,
    "Character": 155,
    "Type": 4,
    "SkinId": 0,
    "VoResource": "vo_155_ui_unlockCG_001",
    "HasVoResource": true,
    "Lines": "那一晚的月光与海浪，想必你也无法忘怀吧。",
    "HasLines": true
